==English==
===Noun===
'''[[mouse]] [[pad]]'''
# {{US}}: A surface used to enhance the movement of a computer [[mouse]].

First invented, named [[mousepad]] and documented by Armando M. Fernandez.  Published by Xerox in 1979,<ref>{{cite web | url = http://www.priorartdatabase.com/IPCOM/000024222/ |title = CRT Cursor Control Mechanism Pad | work =
Xerox Disclosure Journal | date = Nov/Dec 1979 | accessdate=2007-02-26}}</ref>.

